cf-feat-aggressive-block-fighter = Aggressive Block
cf-feat-aggressive-block-fighter-desc = Free action, automatic. When you Shield Block a Strike from an enemy in your reach, you shove it 5 feet away. The rules let the enemy choose to be off-guard instead, and limit it to your size or smaller.
cf-feat-aggressive-block-guardian = Aggressive Block
cf-feat-aggressive-block-guardian-desc = Free action, automatic. When you Shield Block a Strike from an enemy in your reach, you shove it 5 feet away. The rules let the enemy choose to be off-guard instead, and limit it to your size or smaller.
