cf-feat-callofthe-wild = Call of the Wild
cf-feat-callofthe-wild-desc = You can cast Summon Animal in place of any spell you have prepared, at that spell's rank. The cast spends the prepared spell. The rules take 10 minutes to make the swap. Summon Plant or Fungus is not in the game: TBA
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-bard = Cantrip Expansion
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-bard-desc = Choose two more occult cantrips. You can cast them at will.
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-cleric = Cantrip Expansion
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-cleric-desc = Choose two more divine cantrips. You can cast them at will.
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-magus = Cantrip Expansion
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-magus-desc = Choose two more arcane cantrips. You can cast them at will.
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-oracle = Cantrip Expansion
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-oracle-desc = Choose two more divine cantrips. You can cast them at will.
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-psychic = Cantrip Expansion
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-psychic-desc = Choose two more occult cantrips. You can cast them at will.
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-sorcerer = Cantrip Expansion
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-sorcerer-desc = Choose two more cantrips. You can cast them at will.
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-witch = Cantrip Expansion
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-witch-desc = Choose two more cantrips. You can cast them at will.
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-wizard = Cantrip Expansion
cf-feat-cantrip-expansion-wizard-desc = Choose two more arcane cantrips. You can cast them at will.
